# The repo is LF everywhere: it deploys to a Linux VPS (CRLF breaks shebangs and
# systemd units) and is edited from both WSL Claude Code and Windows/PowerShell Codex.
# Normalize every text file to LF on commit and checkout, whatever the editor writes.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Shell scripts must stay LF so they run on the Linux VPS (CRLF breaks the shebang).
*.sh text eol=lf
